timeline
    title MTGS Failure Detection and Recovery
    System Normal : t=0 : Forward & Backward Pass Complete
    Snapshot : t=0+async : Async GPU→CPU shadow copy (dedicated stream)
    Sync Start : t=1 : Ring-All-Reduce begins
    Node Failure : t=2 : Rank 2 crashes (SIGKILL/OOM)
    NCCL Timeout : t=2+500ms : NCCL_ASYNC_ERROR_HANDLING triggers
    Detection : t=2+500ms : Coordinator detects missing vote
    Global Abort : t=2+505ms : Coordinator broadcasts ABORT to all ranks
    Rollback : t=2+510ms : All ranks restore params from CPU shadow
    Training Resumed : t=2+511.67ms : Next training step begins
    Note "ETTR = 1.67 ms<br/>vs minutes for disk checkpoint" at t=2+511.67ms
